    {"category":"MEDICAL","family":"burn_compression_garments","source":"burn_unit_measurements_and_tailor_work_orders","topic":"custom compression garments","story":"Following a major burn injury, fitted pressure garments are needed for two body areas and must be replaced as swelling changes.","support":"The burn unit's measurement card and tailor work order list separate garments, fittings, and replacement dates. The high total covers a full year of changes.","fraud_story":"The request prices a year of custom garments using two matching work orders from the same tailoring studio.","fraud_docs":["Tailor order: six garments for the listed measurements, annual amount ₹3,18,000.","Burn unit issue book: the patient received the same six garments, sizes, and annual package under a hospital grant."],"border_story":"A specialist recommended compression wear, but measurements were taken before swelling settled and the number of replacement sets is unknown.","border_doc":"Clinic instruction: reassess measurements in four weeks; quantity and final supplier estimate to follow."},
    {"category":"MEDICAL","family":"pediatric_metabolic_formula","source":"metabolic_clinic_diet_plan_and_distributor_dispatches","topic":"medically prescribed formula","story":"A child with a diagnosed metabolic condition needs a prescribed formula that is not stocked by nearby pharmacies; the request covers several months of supply.","support":"Dietitian plan gives the daily quantity and distributor invoices price the correct formulation for the documented period. The unusual cost reflects import and cold-chain handling.","fraud_story":"The appeal requests a year's supply of the named formula; the invoice bundle is internally consistent on product code and monthly cost.","fraud_docs":["Distributor invoice: product code M-71, twelve monthly cartons, named patient, annual total ₹4,92,000.","Clinic diet plan: product code M-71 is prescribed for this patient, one carton per month for twelve months."],"border_story":"The clinic has discussed a special formula, but the dietitian has not yet signed the revised plan and the distributor quote expires soon.","border_doc":"Draft nutrition worksheet; prescriber signature and final product code are absent."},
